<title>UK: BOE forecasts 1.85 bln stg shortage, offers help.</title>
<headline>BOE forecasts 1.85 bln stg shortage, offers help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England offered the UK money market an early round of assistance at an unchanged repo rate of 6.0 percent. It forecast a liquidity shortage of around 1.85 billion stg.</p>
<p>The operations will comprise repos to March 21 and 24 and outright offers of bills maturing on or before March 24.</p>
